From: PW3 Android port
Subject: [PW3] SystemUI: quick settings on the first pull

Pulled down from the status bar, the shade shows the collapsed header: one row
of tiles, no brightness slider. The slider needs a second pull or a tap on the
expand arrow ("the brightness control is hidden too deep", user, Test V36);
the Kindle's own panel shows its frontlight slider at once.

config_quickSettingsOnFirstPull (default false, as before) set to true: a pull
that starts on the status bar of a collapsed shade opens quick settings fully,
as a two-finger pull does in AOSP.

--- a/packages/SystemUI/res/values/config.xml
